      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Sorry to ask but I think that the function ServiceState#getCellBandwidths() and onLinkDownstreamBandwidthKbps() does not get any indication of nrState. Why that chage? nrState is not accessible at all. I think this is not a correct fix becase now nrState is complitely \"blinded\".\n\nAlso this flag is important to check if NR carrier is really used. ULI is misleading due to his definition. Report always 5G also when NR carrier is absent.",
      "parentUuid": "2e35fe6f_435e899b",
      "revId": "f33864e651d15aeca1322cb2ce375e918533299b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
